c_roles` (per-lane ROLEâ†’doc map; absent roles omitted, never faked).\n- `effort_history.py` â€” `project_effort_rollup` (cost/tokens/time, lifetime/30d, RUN-provenance only) + `promote_grass_to_lane` (seeded launch; idea stays in grass as a copy).\n- `deliverables.py` â€” `launch_deliverable` (type-aware: skill/toolâ†’verify, serviceâ†’preview â‰  8777, programâ†’run, docâ†’render).\n- `anchor_gui.py` â€” Paradigm-2 cockpit (lane tiles + status lights, inline expanding panel stack replacing the v3 floating window manager), flat one-line project rows, Option B masthead branding.\n\n**Panel layout (locked).** A panel renders summary on top (two-column equal-height split: materials left, role-tagged links right) over a resizable xterm.js terminal below; header shows path + `Î£ tokens Â· $ Â· time`. Accordion panel-manager (`openPanel`/`minimizePanel`/`killPanel`/`repopulate`); X = kill behind an \"Are you sure?\" confirm; minimize keeps the session running.\n\n**Outcome / status (from member Execution Log + project records).** Planned by the Crucible trio across Master Plan â†’ Implementation Plan (Foreman-ready, 9 waves) â†’ Execution Log. **BUILT by Foreman (9 waves GREEN, 637 passed) and MERGED to master 2026-06-13** (merge commit `38fd70e`, off branch `foreman/rnd-surface-v4`). Deploy via `nssm restart anchor` (elevated).\n\n---\n\n*Grounding note:* the member-document set named here is the three planning docs (Master Plan, Implementation Plan, Execution Log). Claims above are drawn from the supplied anchors plus the v4 records already in the project's CLAUDE.md. I did not open the underlying `planning/rnd-v4/` files in this turn â€” if you want the summary verified line-by-line against those frozen docs (e.g., to confirm wave count or the exact role sets), say the word and I'll read them directly."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4412,"cache_creation_input_tokens":24357,"cache_read_input_tokens":20597,"cache_